<title>UK: Deutsche Hyp prices 500 mln mark bond increase. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hyp prices 500 mln mark bond increase. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Pfandbrief 500 million mark increase, has been priced by joint lead managers Dresner, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Commerzbank and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    100.18</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFURT     SPREAD	+24 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  18 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects fee split to &quot;mgt/und 7 bp, sell conc 18 bp&quot; from &quot;mgt/und 6 bp, sell conc 19 bp&quot;.)</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOV BOND BOBL 122</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
